  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, theme 8): INV-hujog-vamon-zafon-mikik-pisah-tanor-pumah-rogij (Pass.requires: list[str] — declare pass dependencies; pre-run validator catches missing prerequisites) is the schema-design correlate of this umbrella. INV-hujog adds the dependency-declaration mechanism that would enable an activation gate; this item documents the observed scan-and-emit-nothing behavior across 4 member items (INV-bikaj being the broadest at 61/84 passes producing 0 edges)."  # a7be
